{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/ben/github/toulmin/evals/toulmin/variants/ask-only/skills/toulmin\n\n# Writing the piece\n\nBefore you write, ask the user for what you are missing. Send one message with at most five questions, the most useful first. Ask only what would change the piece and what the request does not already answer. When the answers come back, write the piece as you normally would, and hand it over. When the user does not know something, write without it and do not guess.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: Grant narrative (500 words max) for a volunteer food bank asking county community foundation for $50,000 toward a $68,000 refrigerated van. Facts: 38,000 lb/month to 610 households; 6,000 lb/month fresh. Last summer turned down ~9,000 lb produce over 3 months. $18,000 from reserves leaving $11,000. 23 regular volunteers, 4 committed drivers weekly. Prior $12,000 shelving grant 2023, final report four months late. User wants to claim van will double fresh food in first year."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70d52254-b25e-46a5-9c69-f31299dec629","uuid":"30897885-005f-4ad9-8d24-a9e6fe657807","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:24:03.444Z","isSynthetic":true}
